    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“If everything is honey and I am what I eat, I must be made of honey,” sings "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Winnie the Pooh",
            "zh": "小熊维尼"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Honey is his "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " food."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Do bears really love honey? Yes. And guess what? They have very expensive "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tastes",
            "ref": "v-taste"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in honey!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Ibrahim Sedef is a bee-keeper in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Türkiye",
            "zh": "土耳其"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Some bears kept “"
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "” his bee farm. They "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "stole",
            "ref": "v-steal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " honey from the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "beehives",
            "zh": "蜂箱"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sedef tried many ways to keep his beehives "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But they didn’t work. One day, he "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "came up with",
            "zh": "想出"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " an idea: why not turn these bears into honey "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tasters",
            "ref": "v-taster"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sedef put four "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on a table. One had cherry jam. The other three had different types of honey. So, which one was the bears’ favourite? "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Anzer honey",
            "zh": "安紫尔蜂蜜"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They always tasted this one "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Anzer honey is one of the most expensive types of honey in the world. It can "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for $300 a kilogram. The bears really had good taste!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
